# Trivy ignore list for StockFlow (owner: security). Empty by design.
#
# Every entry MUST be a block of exactly this shape, enforced by `python scripts/quality_policy.py check`:
#
#   # justification: <why this is not exploitable / no fix exists, and what the mitigation is>
#   # owner: <github handle or role>   (optional, recommended)
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# - `exp:` is Trivy's native expiry syntax: once the date passes, Trivy stops ignoring the finding
#   and `check` fails earlier (also fails on any entry expiring more than trivy.ignore_max_days ahead).
# - Never add a blanket path or a wildcard. One id per line.
